            "text-24": "<p>Whether your cycle feels simple, irregular, or shifting with menopause, FANY Luna helps you track what matters. By understanding your body, you gain real health insights, steadier emotions, and a smoother rhythm to your days. It’s more than tracking—it’s guidance for living with balance and grace.</p>",
